        "original_id": "7f8e0c04-3243-52f1-a542-4a2835da38e3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Blessid Union of Souls, Blue Peter\n- People: Jeff Pence, Eliot Sloan, Chris Wardman, Paul Humphrey\n- Places: Cincinnati, Ohio; Markham, Ontario\n- Songs: \"Hey Leonardo (She Likes Me for Me)\"\n- Albums: \"Walking Off the Buzz\"\n- Genres: alternative rock, new wave, synthpop\n\nFacts:\n- Blue Peter is a Canadian new wave synthpop band founded in 1978 in Markham, Ontario by Chris Wardman and Paul Humphrey.\n- Blessid Union of Souls is an American alternative rock band formed in 1990 in Cincinnati, Ohio by friends Jeff Pence and Eliot Sloan.\n- Blue Peter later opened for major international acts such as the Police and Simple Minds during the band's heyday.\n- \"Hey Leonardo (She Likes Me for Me)\" is a song by Blessid Union of Souls from the band's third album, \"Walking Off the Buzz.\"",
